WEBVTT

1
00:44:32.450 --> 00:44:38.450
What a beautiful sight from here, when you see the church like this.

2
00:44:38.450 --> 00:44:44.450
This is the church. We are the church of Jesus.

3
00:44:46.450 --> 00:44:49.450
I get to make the announcement for the collection.

4
00:44:49.450 --> 00:44:53.450
I want to mention something, I want to explain something.

5
00:44:56.450 --> 00:44:59.450
Shall we start with the text from Colossians?

6
00:45:03.450 --> 00:45:11.450
There are those Bible verses that when you truly realize what they say and you apply them,

7
00:45:11.450 --> 00:45:14.450
they change your entire way of living.

8
00:45:14.450 --> 00:45:16.450
This is one of them.

9
00:45:17.450 --> 00:45:21.450
Whatever you do, do it with all your heart.

10
00:45:23.450 --> 00:45:26.450
Okay, work hard, commit well.

11
00:45:27.450 --> 00:45:32.450
As if you are doing it for the Lord and not for people.

12
00:45:39.450 --> 00:45:40.450
As if you are doing it for the Lord.

13
00:45:40.450 --> 00:45:48.450
Everything you do, whatever you do, do it with all your heart as if you are doing it for God.

14
00:45:50.450 --> 00:45:52.450
That also applies to our work.

15
00:45:53.450 --> 00:45:56.450
We are talking about giving.

16
00:45:57.450 --> 00:45:59.450
It's about money.

17
00:46:01.450 --> 00:46:07.450
Some people might find it uncomfortable, but money is the everyday thing we do all sorts of things with in our lives.

18
00:46:07.450 --> 00:46:13.450
We have a job to earn money.

19
00:46:14.450 --> 00:46:16.450
Why do you work?

20
00:46:16.450 --> 00:46:18.450
Not for the boss.

21
00:46:18.450 --> 00:46:20.450
Why do you work?

22
00:46:20.450 --> 00:46:25.450
To become rich, that’s what people sometimes say.

23
00:46:27.450 --> 00:46:31.450
But let it not be an idol that consumes everything.

24
00:46:31.450 --> 00:46:33.450
That gets all the attention.

25
00:46:33.450 --> 00:46:35.450
That nothing else exists anymore.

26
00:46:37.450 --> 00:46:41.450
With your whole heart as for the Lord.

27
00:46:42.450 --> 00:46:45.450
Then your workday changes.

28
00:46:46.450 --> 00:46:50.450
In Genesis 28, we have Jacob.

29
00:46:50.450 --> 00:46:54.450
And Jacob is at a moment of crisis in his life.

30
00:46:59.450 --> 00:47:03.450
And then he meets God.

31
00:47:05.450 --> 00:47:07.450
In the crisis, God is there.

32
00:47:08.450 --> 00:47:10.450
Whatever the crisis may be.

33
00:47:10.450 --> 00:47:12.450
In the crisis, God is there.

34
00:47:12.450 --> 00:47:14.450
Whether you know it or not, He is there.

35
00:47:14.450 --> 00:47:17.450
Whether you feel it or not, whether you experience it.

36
00:47:18.450 --> 00:47:21.450
Jacob had a revelation.

37
00:47:22.450 --> 00:47:24.450
And he responds to it.

38
00:47:25.450 --> 00:47:31.450
And then he says, I promise that I will give Him a tenth of everything He gives me.

39
00:47:33.450 --> 00:47:36.450
We can do very extensive Bible studies about this.

40
00:47:36.450 --> 00:47:38.450
Tenth this, tenth that.

41
00:47:38.450 --> 00:47:39.450
Law, not law.

42
00:47:39.450 --> 00:47:43.450
Shall we just say that Jacob is a good example?

43
00:47:44.450 --> 00:47:45.450
So simple.

44
00:47:46.450 --> 00:47:48.450
The law did not exist yet.

45
00:47:48.450 --> 00:47:52.450
And he says, he wants to dedicate himself to God.

46
00:47:52.450 --> 00:47:55.450
And he says, I want to give a tenth to God.

47
00:47:55.450 --> 00:47:57.450
His own choice.

48
00:47:58.450 --> 00:48:01.450
I have decided to follow that example.

49
00:48:01.450 --> 00:48:05.450
Many other people here in the church have decided to follow that example.

50
00:48:07.450 --> 00:48:09.450
Are you here as a guest?

51
00:48:09.450 --> 00:48:10.450
You know?

52
00:48:11.450 --> 00:48:13.450
You are welcome to be a guest.

53
00:48:14.450 --> 00:48:16.450
You do not have to contribute as a guest.

54
00:48:18.450 --> 00:48:24.450
Are you here as someone who has chosen to be part of this church?

55
00:48:24.450 --> 00:48:27.450
To be part of this family of God.

56
00:48:27.450 --> 00:48:29.450
Of this family.

57
00:48:32.450 --> 00:48:33.450
You know?

58
00:48:33.450 --> 00:48:36.450
The gospel is free.

59
00:48:36.450 --> 00:48:37.450
It is free.

60
00:48:37.450 --> 00:48:38.450
Our salvation.

61
00:48:38.450 --> 00:48:40.450
That we have life in Christ.

62
00:48:40.450 --> 00:48:43.450
That we have freedom.

63
00:48:43.450 --> 00:48:49.450
That we are freed from patterns that lead to destruction.

64
00:48:50.450 --> 00:48:51.450
That is free.

65
00:48:53.450 --> 00:48:57.450
But that requires us to dedicate ourselves.

66
00:48:58.450 --> 00:49:02.450
And dedicating yourself, you do that with your whole life.

67
00:49:03.450 --> 00:49:08.450
So it is free and it costs us everything.

68
00:49:08.450 --> 00:49:10.450
That is the gospel.

69
00:49:20.450 --> 00:49:21.450
I have so much to...

70
00:49:21.450 --> 00:49:23.450
Too many thoughts are going through my mind.

71
00:49:23.450 --> 00:49:24.450
You know?

72
00:49:26.450 --> 00:49:30.450
As a church, we also have regular budgeting.

73
00:49:31.450 --> 00:49:37.450
And this is a moment where I am having a sort of kitchen table conversation.

74
00:49:37.450 --> 00:49:38.450
Do you know that at home?

75
00:49:38.450 --> 00:49:42.450
Do you also talk at the kitchen table about your finances and your plans?

76
00:49:42.450 --> 00:49:44.450
Also okay, at the dining table then.

77
00:49:44.450 --> 00:49:45.450
Yes?

78
00:49:46.450 --> 00:49:50.450
Do you ever talk to each other about your finances and your plans?

79
00:49:50.450 --> 00:49:52.450
And what do you want to do?

80
00:49:52.450 --> 00:49:54.450
And what do you want to save for?

81
00:49:54.450 --> 00:49:55.450
That is healthy.

82
00:49:55.450 --> 00:49:56.450
That is simply healthy.

83
00:49:56.450 --> 00:50:01.450
We are appointed as stewards over what has been given to us and we manage that.

84
00:50:02.450 --> 00:50:06.450
This is a biblical work ethic and stewardship.

85
00:50:06.450 --> 00:50:10.450
Work hard, as if it is for the Lord.

86
00:50:11.450 --> 00:50:13.450
And may I encourage you?

87
00:50:13.450 --> 00:50:15.450
Give your tithe in the church.

88
00:50:15.450 --> 00:50:19.450
For through the church, God realizes His plan.

89
00:50:19.450 --> 00:50:22.450
In this region, at this place.

90
00:50:23.450 --> 00:50:28.450
And there are often many thoughts about it.

91
00:50:28.450 --> 00:50:30.450
There are many thoughts.

92
00:50:32.450 --> 00:50:36.450
There are people who are financially stuck.

93
00:50:37.450 --> 00:50:38.450
That can happen.

94
00:50:38.450 --> 00:50:42.450
And then the Bible says, you know, you should not give so much that you become in need yourself afterwards.

95
00:50:42.450 --> 00:50:44.450
That you need help yourself afterwards.

96
00:50:44.450 --> 00:50:45.450
That is simply not healthy.

97
00:50:45.450 --> 00:50:47.450
That is not wise.

98
00:50:48.450 --> 00:50:54.450
There are also many people who are financially stuck.

99
00:50:54.450 --> 00:50:59.450
Actually due to unwise decisions.

100
00:51:00.450 --> 00:51:06.450
For our entire society is geared towards consumption.

101
00:51:06.450 --> 00:51:10.450
And our whole society screams every time.

102
00:51:10.450 --> 00:51:12.450
This vacation, this.

103
00:51:12.450 --> 00:51:16.450
And you see on your social media what that does.

104
00:51:16.450 --> 00:51:17.450
And what that does.

105
00:51:17.450 --> 00:51:19.450
And what all that does.

106
00:51:19.450 --> 00:51:21.450
And you have to be able to go along with that.

107
00:51:21.450 --> 00:51:24.450
Because I also want to be seen so badly.

108
00:51:26.450 --> 00:51:28.450
You are seen by God.

109
00:51:29.450 --> 00:51:31.450
You are seen by God.

110
00:51:36.450 --> 00:51:40.450
Of course, we also want to have the recognition of the people around us.

111
00:51:40.450 --> 00:51:43.450
But you are seen by God.

112
00:51:46.450 --> 00:51:49.450
And we don't always need more, more, more.

113
00:51:49.450 --> 00:51:56.450
Throughout church history, moderation has been one of the seven virtues.

114
00:51:56.450 --> 00:51:58.450
Moderation.

115
00:51:59.450 --> 00:52:03.450
That also means that we can simply live financially disciplined.

116
00:52:05.450 --> 00:52:08.450
And you do that with an eye on God.

117
00:52:08.450 --> 00:52:13.450
You do that with an eye to having a healthy financial household.

118
00:52:13.450 --> 00:52:16.450
Do we always have to incur debt to have things?

119
00:52:16.450 --> 00:52:20.450
I have heard practical things before, you know.

120
00:52:21.450 --> 00:52:26.450
Yes, you can certainly take out a loan for a car.

121
00:52:26.450 --> 00:52:29.450
But know that you are tied to it for years.

122
00:52:29.450 --> 00:52:31.450
Be wise.

123
00:52:32.450 --> 00:52:36.450
I have heard of people who take out a loan for a vacation.

124
00:52:36.450 --> 00:52:39.450
After that, you have had the vacation and you are still paying off the loan.

125
00:52:39.450 --> 00:52:42.450
Very foolish. May I say it like that?

126
00:52:42.450 --> 00:52:45.450
That vacation, then you just don't take a vacation?

127
00:52:45.450 --> 00:52:48.450
That's not a shame. You miss nothing.

128
00:52:48.450 --> 00:52:51.450
Do other things during that time with your family, with your relatives.

129
00:52:53.450 --> 00:52:56.450
No, but we need to be sober. Come on.

130
00:52:57.450 --> 00:53:03.450
Also in the church, we budget moderately.

131
00:53:03.450 --> 00:53:07.450
The building we are constructing is not an extravagant building.

132
00:53:07.450 --> 00:53:09.450
It's not about, about, about.

133
00:53:09.450 --> 00:53:13.450
It is functional. Basic. Functional.

134
00:53:13.450 --> 00:53:17.450
The installation we have here, yes, we dress it up nicely.

135
00:53:17.450 --> 00:53:20.450
But in essence, it is just functional.

136
00:53:21.450 --> 00:53:24.450
We don't have extravagant items.

137
00:53:24.450 --> 00:53:27.450
We don't have extravagant items here.

138
00:53:27.450 --> 00:53:29.450
That's not necessary.

139
00:53:31.450 --> 00:53:34.450
Because our heart honors God.

140
00:53:34.450 --> 00:53:36.450
And that is necessary.

141
00:53:37.450 --> 00:53:41.450
You know, I was talking about the kitchen table conversation.

142
00:53:44.450 --> 00:53:47.450
Look at the budgets of the church.

143
00:53:47.450 --> 00:53:51.450
We just had that round again and we talked about it well.

144
00:53:51.450 --> 00:53:54.450
There is thought given to it.

145
00:53:54.450 --> 00:54:01.450
Because we also want to manage that carefully and be good stewards in the church.

146
00:54:03.450 --> 00:54:08.450
And then you see a number of trends in society that the church has to deal with.

147
00:54:08.450 --> 00:54:12.450
One of those trends is that inflation is still quite high.

148
00:54:12.450 --> 00:54:19.450
But that also means that the adjustments in salaries...

149
00:54:19.450 --> 00:54:26.450
...according to the norms we have contractually agreed upon as a church, which are 5%.

150
00:54:26.450 --> 00:54:28.450
How come?

151
00:54:28.450 --> 00:54:37.450
Because in the past year, across society, the collective labor agreement wages have gone up by 5%.

152
00:54:37.450 --> 00:54:40.450
Cao, the common agreements in the Netherlands.

153
00:54:40.450 --> 00:54:44.450
We generally follow the Dutch system in the church.

154
00:54:46.450 --> 00:54:48.450
5% is quite substantial.

155
00:54:48.450 --> 00:54:53.450
But that also means that, as we sit here in the church...

156
00:54:53.450 --> 00:54:59.450
...our incomes grossomodo have gone up by that percentage in the past year.

157
00:55:00.450 --> 00:55:05.450
So, when you sit at home at the kitchen table...

158
00:55:06.450 --> 00:55:09.450
No, that's really true.

159
00:55:09.450 --> 00:55:14.450
The system of the organization church and work that we follow...

160
00:55:14.450 --> 00:55:17.450
...looks at what is happening in society...

161
00:55:17.450 --> 00:55:23.450
...who dare to simply adjust the large collective labor agreements for very large groups of employees...

162
00:55:23.450 --> 00:55:33.450
...and that is the basis on which the scales of people in church work are adjusted each year.

163
00:55:34.450 --> 00:55:37.450
So there is simply a look at what is happening in society?

164
00:55:37.450 --> 00:55:40.450
What happens in society also happens in the church.

165
00:55:40.450 --> 00:55:46.450
And it is therefore fitting that those who are paid to work in the church...

166
00:55:46.450 --> 00:55:49.450
...are compensated in the same way.

167
00:55:49.450 --> 00:55:51.450
That is simply fitting, that is simply beautiful.

168
00:55:52.450 --> 00:55:58.450
So see if what you give still fits with your salary.

169
00:55:59.450 --> 00:56:00.450
Check that.

170
00:56:00.450 --> 00:56:02.450
At the moment your salary goes up...

171
00:56:02.450 --> 00:56:06.450
...for me that was January 1st, for other people it is often April 1st.

172
00:56:07.450 --> 00:56:11.450
Then see if you can adjust your monthly transfer.

173
00:56:13.450 --> 00:56:16.450
And you know, for those who think...

174
00:56:16.450 --> 00:56:21.450
...actually I would like to give more, but that’s just not possible.

175
00:56:25.450 --> 00:56:26.450
I have this advice.

176
00:56:26.450 --> 00:56:28.450
Give according to faith.

177
00:56:29.450 --> 00:56:32.450
But it doesn't have to be a gigantic step all at once.

178
00:56:33.450 --> 00:56:35.450
You can also take a small step.

179
00:56:36.450 --> 00:56:38.450
And in six months take another small step.

180
00:56:39.450 --> 00:56:42.450
And at the moment that salary increase comes...

181
00:56:42.450 --> 00:56:46.450
...then you say, you know what, now I have the space to go a little higher.

182
00:56:48.450 --> 00:56:50.450
There is nothing wrong with saying...

183
00:56:51.450 --> 00:56:53.450
There is nothing wrong with saying...

184
00:56:54.450 --> 00:56:59.450
Test God with small steps and see how He blesses you in that.

185
00:57:00.450 --> 00:57:04.450
Test God with one more step. See how He blesses you.

186
00:57:05.450 --> 00:57:07.450
Test God with one more step.

187
00:57:09.450 --> 00:57:12.450
And you know, after a while it becomes fun.

188
00:57:13.450 --> 00:57:14.450
That is really true.

189
00:57:15.450 --> 00:57:16.450
After a while it becomes fun.

190
00:57:17.450 --> 00:57:23.450
Make that foundational setting today and set your goal today.

191
00:57:23.450 --> 00:57:26.450
So choose. Choose today. Choose today where you want to go.

192
00:57:28.450 --> 00:57:30.450
With my whole heart for the Lord.

193
00:57:32.450 --> 00:57:34.450
And a tenth of everything I receive.

194
00:57:35.450 --> 00:57:36.450
Thank you.

195
00:57:46.450 --> 00:57:47.450
Good morning everyone.

